  "title": "Enforce back/forward navigation safety and draft recovery across retailer, supplier, superadmin, and POS",
  "description": "Execution contract from live staging UX audit: users must never get stuck mid-flow and must never lose in-progress data unintentionally. Implement deterministic draft lifecycle for required forms and workflows: (1) unsaved-change guard for back/forward/route-leave/close, (2) explicit Resume Draft vs Start Fresh choice on re-entry, (3) safe refresh behavior preserving resumable state where required, (4) explicit discard with confirmation, (5) no stale ghost draft restoration after explicit discard. Scope includes retailer stock and onboarding flows, supplier product/stock flows, superadmin edit forms, and POS in-progress cart/checkout flows.",
